<graph edgedefault="directed"><node id="674a8dd5-ef43-42bb-af9f-f794c1093150">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Term Life Policy","text":"═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n           RETURN OF PREMIUM TERM LIFE INSURANCE POLICY\n           ValueGuard Life Insurance Company\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPolicy No: VG-ROP-2024-4183\nIssued: September 15, 2024\nType: 20-Year Return of Premium Term Life\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nINSURED\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nName: Nicole Christine Martinez\nDate of Birth: April 7, 1988\nGender: Female\nAge at Issue: 36\nSmoker Status: Non-Smoker\nRating: Preferred Plus\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nCOVERAGE AND PREMIUMS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nDeath Benefit: $300,000\nPolicy Term: 20 years (ending September 15, 2044)\nAnnual Premium: $1,620\nPremium Mode: Annual\nReturn of Premium at End of Term: $32,400 (if policy maintained)\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBENEFICIARY DESIGNATION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Carlos Roberto Martinez (Husband) - 100%\nContingent: Sofia Isabella Martinez (","summary":"This document presents a 20-year return-of-premium term life insurance policy issued to Nicole Christine Martinez, offering a $300,000 death benefit with an annual premium of $1,620. If the policyholder survives the full term, they receive a refund of $32,400 in premiums paid. The primary beneficiary is her husband, Carlos Roberto Martinez, with contingent designation to their daughter, Sofia Isabella Martinez.","topics":["Life Insurance","Term Policy","Beneficiary Designation","Premium Returns"],"facts":[{"name":"Insurer Identification","sentence":"The insurer issuing the policy is ValueGuard Life Insurance Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Insurance Provider","Policy Issuer","Company Name"],"entities":[{"name":"Nicole Christine Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"insured individual under policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"September 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of the policy","relational_anchors":["VG-ROP-2024-4183"]},{"name":"Return of Premium Term Life Insurance Policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insurance product offered","relational_anchors":["VG-ROP-2024-4183","20-year term","annual premium mode"]},{"name":"ValueGuard Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer","relational_anchors":["VG-ROP-2024-4183"]},{"name":"VG-ROP-2024-4183","type":"NUMBER","role":"unique identifier for the policy","relational_anchors":["issued: September 15, 2024","death benefit: $300,000"]},{"name":"20-Year Return of Premium Term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"term duration and feature of coverage","relational_anchors":["end date: September 15, 2044","return amount: $32,400"]},{"name":"$300,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"death benefit payout amount","relational_anchors":["VG-ROP-2024-4183"]},{"name":"September 15, 2044","type":"DATE","role":"expiration date of policy term","relational_anchors":["Policy Term: 20 years","VG-ROP-2024-4183"]},{"name":"$1,620","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium cost","relational_anchors":["VG-ROP-2024-4183","premium mode: annual"]},{"name":"$32,400","type":"AMOUNT","role":"total refundable premiums upon end of term","relational_anchors":["Return of Premium at End of Term","VG-ROP-2024-4183"]},{"name":"Carlos Roberto Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary designated","relational_anchors":["100%","husband"]},{"name":"Sofia Isabella Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary listed","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"20-Year Return of Premium Term","sentence":"The policy type is 20-Year Return of Premium Term Life.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["return of premium","term life insurance","policy term"],"entities":[{"name":"Nicole Christin