<node id="4c533141-5ac5-44bb-957d-6acbadf835c1">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Life Insurance Terms","text":"═════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Carlos Roberto Martinez (Husband) - 100%\nContingent: Sofia Isabella Martinez (Daughter) - 50%\n            Marco Daniel Martinez (Son) - 50%\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 1: POLICY FEATURES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n1.1 This is a Return of Premium (ROP) Term Life Insurance Policy.\n\n1.2 UNIQUE FEATURE: If the insured survives the 20-year term and \n    all premiums have been paid, we will return 100% of all \n    premiums paid ($32,400) to the policy owner.\n\n1.3 This policy combines:\n    • Life insurance protection during the term\n    • Return of all premiums if you outlive the term\n    • Option to convert to permanent insurance\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 2: DEATH BENEFIT\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n2.1 If the insured dies during the policy term while the policy \n    is in force, we will pay $300,000 to the beneficiary.\n\n2.2 The death benefit is payable in addition to any proportional \n    premium refund (see Section 3).\n\n2.3 Beneficiaries must submit:\n    • Certified death certificate\n    • Completed claim form\n    • Government-issued ID\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 3: RETURN OF PREMIUM PROVISIONS\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","summary":"This is a 20-year Return of Premium (ROP) term life insurance policy providing $300,000 in death benefits if the insured passes away during the term. If the insured survives the term and all premiums are paid, 100% of premiums ($32,400) are returned to the policyholder. The primary beneficiary is the husband, with contingent beneficiaries being his daughter and son, each receiving 50%. Claims require a certified death certificate, claim form, and government ID.","topics":["Life Insurance","Return of Premium","Death Benefit","Beneficiary Distribution"],"facts":[{"name":"Husband Designation","sentence":"Carlos Roberto Martinez is the husband.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["husband","beneficiary designations","policy ownership"],"entities":[{"name":"Carlos Roberto Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Insured husband and primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sofia Isabella Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent beneficiary daughter","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Marco Daniel Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent beneficiary son","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Return of Premium (ROP)","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Unique policy feature ensuring full refund","relational_anchors":["20-year term","all premiums paid","$32,400"]},{"name":"Life insurance protection","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Core coverage during policy term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Option to convert to permanent insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Conversion right upon term end","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$300,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"Death benefit payout amount","relational_anchors":["Section 2.1"]},{"name":"20-year term","type":"DATE","role":"Duration of policy coverage period","relational_anchors":["survives the 20-year term"]},{"name":"Certified death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Required proof for claiming death benefit","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]},{"name":"Completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Mandatory submission for claims processing","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]},{"name":"Government-issued ID","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Identity verification requirement","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]}]},{"name":"Primary Beneficiary Designation","sentence":"Carlos Roberto Martinez is the primary beneficiary of the life insurance policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["primary beneficiary","death benefit","beneficiary designation"],"entities":[{"name":"Carlos Roberto Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Insured husband and primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sofia Isabella Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent beneficiary daughter","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Marco Daniel Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent beneficiary son","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Return of Premium (ROP)","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Unique policy feature ensuring full refund","relational_anchors":["20-year term","all premiums paid","$32,400"]},{"name":"Life insurance protection","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Core coverage during policy term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Option to convert to permanent insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Conversion right upon term end","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$300,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"Death benefit payout amount","relational_anchors":["Section 2.1"]},{"name":"20-year term","type":"DATE","role":"Duration of policy coverage period","relational_anchors":["survives the 20-year term"]},{"name":"Certified death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Required proof for claiming death benefit","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]},{"name":"Completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Mandatory submission for claims processing","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]},{"name":"Government-issued ID","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Identity verification requirement","relational_anchors":["Section 2.3"]}]},{"name":"Policy Owner Ownership","sentence":"The ownership percentage of Carlos Roberto Martinez is 100%.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy ownership","primary beneficiary","insured individual"],"entities":[{"name":"Carlos Roberto Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Insured husband and primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sofia Isabella Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent beneficiary daughter","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Marco Daniel Martinez","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent bene