<node id="6316c703-8278-48de-a218-21557659173f">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Terms &amp; Conditions","text":"═════════\nSECTION 3: RETURN OF PREMIUM PROVISIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n3.1 END OF TERM ROP:\n    If the insured is alive on September 15, 2044, and all \n    premiums have been paid, we will pay the policy owner \n    $32,400 (100% of premiums paid over 20 years).\n\n3.2 EARLY SURRENDER ROP:\n    If you surrender this policy before the end of term:\n    \n    Years 1-5:   0% premium return\n    Years 6-10:  30% of premiums paid returned\n    Years 11-15: 60% of premiums paid returned\n    Years 16-19: 90% of premiums paid returned\n    Year 20:     100% of premiums paid returned\n\n3.3 DEATH DURING TERM:\n    If death occurs during the term, beneficiaries receive:\n    • Full death benefit ($300,000), PLUS\n    • A proportional premium refund based on the early surrender \n      schedule above\n\n    Example: If death occurs in Year 8, beneficiaries receive:\n    $300,000 death benefit + (30% × $12,960 premiums paid) = \n    $300,000 + $3,888 = $303,888\n\n3.4 ROP payments are made within 60 days of the applicable date.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 4: PREMIUM PAYMENT REQUIREMENTS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n4.1 Annual premium of $1,620 is due each September 15.\n\n4.2 Premiums are LEVEL and will not increase during the term.\n\n4.3 CRITICAL: To receive the full return of premium at end of","summary":"This document describes the Return of Premium (ROP) terms for a 20-year life insurance policy. If the insured survives until September 15, 2044, and all premiums are paid, the policyholder receives 100% of premiums paid—$32,400. Early surrenders yield increasing percentages of refunded premiums depending on how long the policy has been held, ranging from 0% in years 1–5 to 100% in year 20. In the event of death during the term, beneficiaries receive the full $300,000 death benefit plus a proportionate refund based on the same early surrender scale. Premiums are fixed annually at $1,620, payable every September 15.","topics":["Return of Premium","Policy Surrender","Death Benefit","Premium Payments"],"facts":[{"name":"End of Term ROP Date","sentence":"The policy term ends on September 15, 2044.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Return of Premium","Policy Termination","September 15, 2044"],"entities":[{"name":"$32,400","type":"AMOUNT","role":"full premium return amount","relational_anchors":["100% of premiums paid over 20 years"]},{"name":"0%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 1–5","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"30%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 6–10","relational_anchors":["Year 8"]},{"name":"60%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 11–15","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 16–19","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"100%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"full premium return rate at year 20","relational_anchors":["End of Term ROP","Year 20"]},{"name":"$300,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"death benefit payout","relational_anchors":["Full death benefit"]},{"name":"$12,960","type":"AMOUNT","role":"total premiums paid up to year 8","relational_anchors":["30% × $12,960 premiums paid"]},{"name":"$3,888","type":"AMOUNT","role":"proportional premium refund in year 8","relational_anchors":["30% × $12,960"]},{"name":"September 15, 2044","type":"DATE","role":"end-of-term eligibility date","relational_anchors":["If the insured is alive on September 15, 2044"]},{"name":"September 15","type":"DATE","role":"annual premium due date","relational_anchors":["Annual premium of $1,620 is due each September 15"]},{"name":"Years 1–5","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"early surrender period with zero return","relational_anchors":["0% premium return"]},{"name":"Years 6–10","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period with 30% return","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"Years 11–15","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period with 60% return","relational_anchors":["60%"]},{"name":"Years 16–19","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period with 90% return","relational_anchors":["90%"]},{"name":"Year 20","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"final year with 100% return","relational_anchors":["100% of premiums paid returned"]},{"name":"SECTION 3: RETURN OF PREMIUM PROVISIONS","type":"SECTION","role":"main section header for ROP rules","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"3.1 END OF TERM ROP:","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"sub-section detailing final maturity return condition","relational_anchors":["September 15, 2044","$32,400"]},{"name":"3.2 EARLY SURRENDER ROP:","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"sub-section outlining tiered returns upon early exit","relational_anchors":["Years 1–5","30%","60%","90%","100%"]},{"name":"3.3 DEATH DURING TERM:","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"sub-section governing benefits if death occurs mid-term","relational_anchors":["$300,000","proportional premium refund"]},{"name":"3.4 ROP payments are made within 60 days of the applicable date.","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"timing rule for disbursement of ROP funds","relational_anchors":["within 60 days"]},{"name":"SECTION 4: PREMIUM PAYMENT REQUIREMENTS","type":"SECTION","role":"section header for payment obligations","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"4.1 Annual premium of $1,620 is due each September 15.","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"rule specifying annual payment amount and due date","relational_anchors":["$1,620","September 15"]},{"name":"4.2 Premiums are LEVEL and will not increase during the term.","type":"SUBSECTION","role":"stability clause ensuring fixed premiums","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"CRITICAL: To receive the full return of premium at end of","type":"CRITICAL_NOTE","role":"warning about eligibility requirement","relational_anchors":["end of term"]}]},{"name":"End-of-Term Return of Premium","sentence":"If the insured is alive on September 15, 2044, and all premiums have been paid, the policy owner will receive $32,400.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Return of Premium","Survival Benefit","Final Payment Condition"],"entities":[{"name":"$32,400","type":"AMOUNT","role":"full premium return amount","relational_anchors":["100% of premiums paid over 20 years"]},{"name":"0%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 1–5","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"30%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 6–10","relational_anchors":["Year 8"]},{"name":"60%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 11–15","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"premium return rate for years 16–19","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"100%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"full premium return rate at year 20","relational_anchors":["End of Term ROP","Year 20"]},{"name":"$300,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"death benefit payout","relational_anchors":["Full death benefit"]},{"name":"$12,960","type":"AMOUNT","role":"total premiums paid up to year 8","relational_anchors":["30% × $12,960 premiums paid"]},{"name":"$3,888","type":"AMOUNT","role":"proportional premium refund in year 8","relational_anchors":["30% × $12,960"]},{"name":"September 15, 2044","type":"DATE","role":"end-of-term eligibility date","relational_anchors":["If the insured is alive on September 15, 2044"]},{"name":"September 15","type":"DATE","role":"annual premium due date","relational_anchors":["Annual premium of $1,620 is due each September 15"]},{"name":"Years 1–5","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"early surrender period with zero return","relational_anchors":["0% premium return"]},{"name":"Years 6–10","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period with 30% return","relational_anchors":["30%"]},{"name":"Years 11–15","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period with 60% return","relational_anchors":["60%"]},{"name":"Years 16–19","type":"POLICY_TERM","role":"surrender period wit