<node id="40183084-759c-477e-9d86-2773cd57e4fd">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Life Insurance Terms","text":".1 Annual premium of $1,620 is due each September 15.\n\n4.2 Premiums are LEVEL and will not increase during the term.\n\n4.3 CRITICAL: To receive the full return of premium at end of \n    term, ALL premiums must be paid on time.\n\n4.4 Grace period: 31 days. If premium is not paid within grace \n    period, policy lapses and return of premium benefit is \n    forfeited.\n\n4.5 Missed premiums cannot be made up. If a premium is paid late \n    (during grace period), the ROP benefit is reduced by 10% for \n    each late payment.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 5: CONVERSION PRIVILEGE\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n5.1 You may convert this policy to a permanent life insurance \n    policy without evidence of insurability.\n\n5.2 Conversion available:\n    • At any time before the policy expires, OR\n    • Before the insured's 65th birthday, whichever is earlier\n\n5.3 Minimum conversion amount: $50,000\n    Maximum conversion amount: $300,000 (current face amount)\n\n5.4 Upon conversion:\n    • New policy premium based on attained age\n    • ROP benefit is forfeited\n    • Premiums paid to date are NOT returned\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 6: POLICY LOANS AND WITHDRAWALS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n6.1 Policy loans are NOT available under this policy type.\n\n6.2 Partial withdrawals are NOT permitted.\n\n6.3 The only way to access cash value is through:\n    • Full surrender (with applicable ROP percentage), OR\n    • Waiting until end of term for full ROP payment\n\n════════════════════","summary":"This policy requires an annual premium of $1,620 payable every September 15, which remains level throughout the term. To qualify for the full return of premiums at maturity, all payments must be made on time; late payments reduce the return by 10% per occurrence, and missed premiums result in forfeiture of the return benefit entirely. The policy offers a conversion privilege to permanent insurance without medical proof, up to age 65 or prior to expiration, though this ends the return-of-premium feature. No policy loans or partial withdrawals are allowed—cash value can only be accessed via full surrender or waiting until the end of the term.","topics":["Life Insurance Terms","Premium Payments","Return of Premium","Policy Conversion"],"facts":[{"name":"Annual Premium Amount","sentence":"The annual premium is $1,620.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["annual premium","policy cost","premium payment"],"entities":[{"name":"Annual premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment obligation due annually","relational_anchors":["$1,620"]},{"name":"September 15","type":"DATE","role":"due date for annual premium","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"LEVEL premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"premium remains constant over term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Full return of premium","type":"CRITICAL_CONDITION","role":"requirement for full refund at term end","relational_anchors":["ALL premiums must be paid on time"]},{"name":"Grace period","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"window for late payment without lapse","relational_anchors":["31 days"]},{"name":"Policy lapses","type":"CONSEQUENCE","role":"result of unpaid premium after grace period","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ROP benefit reduction","type":"PENALTY","role":"penalty for late premium payment","relational_anchors":["reduced by 10% for each late payment"]},{"name":"Missed premiums cannot be made up","type":"CONCEPT","role":"no retroactive correction allowed","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Conversion privilege","type":"CONCEPT","role":"right to switch to permanent policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Before policy expiration","type":"CONDITION","role":"timing condition for conversion","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Insured's 65th birthday","type":"AGE_THRESHOLD","role":"earliest deadline for conversion","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Minimum conversion amount","type":"AMOUNT_RANGE","role":"lower limit for policy conversion","relational_anchors":["$50,000"]},{"name":"Maximum conversion amount","type":"AMOUNT_RANGE","role":"upper limit for policy conversion","relational_anchors":["$300,000","current face amount"]},{"name":"New policy premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"determined by attained age post-conversion","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ROP benefit forfeited","type":"CONSEQUENCE","role":"loss of return upon conversion","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Premiums paid to date","type":"NON_REFUNDABLE_COST","role":"not refunded upon conversion","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy loans not available","type":"LIMITATION","role":"restriction on borrowing against policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Partial withdrawals not permitted","type":"LIMITATION","role":"restriction on accessing cash value incrementally","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Full surrender","type":"CASH_ACCESS_METHOD","role":"method to access cash value early","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"Waiting until end of term","type":"CASH_ACCESS_METHOD","role":"alternative method for receiving ROP","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Annual Premium Due Date","sentence":"The annual premium is due on September 15 each year.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["premium due date","September 15","payment schedule"],"entities":[{"name":"Annual premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment obligation due annually","relational_anchors":["$1,620"]},{"name":"September 15","type":"DATE","role":"due date for annual premium","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"LEVEL premiums","type":"CONCEPT","role":"premium remains constant over term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Full return of premium","type":"CRITICAL_CONDITION","role":"requirement for full refund at term end","relational_anchors":["ALL premiums must be paid on 