<node id="c4bb8971-758e-49b9-8281-fffeccfe803f">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Policy Provisions","text":".\n\n6.3 The only way to access cash value is through:\n    • Full surrender (with applicable ROP percentage), OR\n    • Waiting until end of term for full ROP payment\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 7: EXCLUSIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n7.1 SUICIDE: If the insured dies by suicide within 24 months of \n    the issue date, we will pay only the premiums paid without \n    interest. No death benefit is payable.\n\n7.2 MATERIAL MISREPRESENTATION: We may contest the policy within \n    2 years of issue if there was material misrepresentation in \n    the application.\n\n7.3 NO OTHER EXCLUSIONS: No war, aviation, travel, or hazardous \n    activity exclusions apply.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 8: REINSTATEMENT\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n8.1 If the policy lapses, you may apply for reinstatement within \n    5 years if:\n    • You provide satisfactory evidence of insurability\n    • You pay all past due premiums with interest at 6% per annum\n    • The insured is still alive\n\n8.2 Upon reinstatement, the ROP benefit is recalculated to exclude \n    the lapsed period.\n\n8.3 A new 2-year suicide and contestability period begins upon \n    reinstatement.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 9: IMPORTANT POLICY NOTES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n9.1 This policy costs more than standard term life insurance \n    because of the return of premium","summary":"This section details how cash value can be accessed—either through full surrender with a reduction based on ROP percentages or by waiting until the end of the term. Key exclusions include no payout for suicide within two years of issuance and potential contestability due to material misrepresentation; however, there are no exclusions for war, aviation, or hazardous activities. Reinstatement is possible within five years post-lapse provided proof of insurability, repayment of overdue premiums plus 6% interest, and continued survival of the insured. Upon reinstatement, the ROP calculation resets excluding the lapsed time, and a new two-year contestability window starts. The policy carries a higher cost compared to standard term life insurance due to its return-of-premium feature.","topics":["Cash Value Access","Policy Exclusions","Reinstatement Terms","Return of Premium"],"facts":[{"name":"Accessing Cash Value Methods","sentence":"The only ways to access cash value are through full surrender with an applicable ROP percentage or waiting until the end of the term for full ROP payment.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["cash value access","full surrender","ROP payment","end-of-term payout"],"entities":[{"name":"Full surrender","type":"CONCEPT","role":"method to access cash value","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"Waiting until end of term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"alternative method for ROP payment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"SUICIDE","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"exclusion condition during first 24 months","relational_anchors":["within 24 months of issue date"]},{"name":"MATERIAL MISREPRESENTATION","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"contestable event within two years","relational_anchors":["contested within 2 years of issue"]},{"name":"NO WAR, AVIATION, TRAVEL, HAZARDOUS ACTIVITY EXCLUSIONS","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"absence of additional risk exclusions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy lapses","type":"CONDITION","role":"trigger for reinstatement eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Apply for reinstatement within 5 years","type":"CONDITION","role":"time limit for reinstating lapse","relational_anchors":["5 years"]},{"name":"Satisfactory evidence of insurability","type":"REQUIREMENT","role":"proof required for reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Past due premiums with interest at 6% per annum","type":"FINANCIAL_TERM","role":"financial obligation for reinstatement","relational_anchors":["6% per annum"]},{"name":"Insured is still alive","type":"STATUS","role":"eligibility criterion for reinstatement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ROP benefit recalculated","type":"CALCULATION","role":"adjustment after reinstatement","relational_anchors":["exclude the lapsed period"]},{"name":"New 2-year suicide and contestability period","type":"PERIOD","role":"renewed exclusion window post-reinstatement","relational_anchors":["2-year"]},{"name":"This policy costs more than standard term life insurance","type":"ECONOMIC_FACTOR","role":"cost implication due to ROP feature","relational_anchors":["because of the return of premium"]}]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion Clause","sentence":"If the insured dies by suicide within 24 months of the issue date, the insurer will pay only the premiums paid without interest.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["suicide exclusion","premiums returned","contestability period"],"entities":[{"name":"Full surrender","type":"CONCEPT","role":"method to access cash value","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"Waiting until end of term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"alternative method for ROP payment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"SUICIDE","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"exclusion condition during first 24 months","relational_anchors":["within 24 months of issue date"]},{"name":"MATERIAL MISREPRESENTATION","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"contestable event within two years","relational_anchors":["contested within 2 years of issue"]},{"name":"NO WAR, AVIATION, TRAVEL, HAZARDOUS ACTIVITY EXCLUSIONS","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"absence of additional risk exclusions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy lapses","type":"CONDITION","role":"trigger for reinstatement eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Apply for reinstatement within 5 yea