<node id="71e071f9-29b7-4843-99d8-3a4530d7d19a">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Return of Premium Life Insurance Terms","text":"═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n9.1 This policy costs more than standard term life insurance \n    because of the return of premium feature.\n\n9.2 The ROP benefit is NOT considered a taxable gain when paid \n    (consult your tax advisor).\n\n9.3 This policy does NOT build cash value that can be borrowed \n    against during the term.\n\n9.4 MISSTATEMENT OF AGE: If age was misstated, we will adjust \n    the death benefit to what the premium would have purchased \n    at the correct age. ROP amount is not affected.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 10: OWNER RIGHTS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n10.1 As policy owner, you may:\n     • Change beneficiaries at any time\n     • Convert to permanent insurance\n     • Assign the policy as collateral\n     • Surrender the policy for the applicable ROP percentage\n\n10.2 Changes must be submitted in writing to our home office.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nFor questions or service, contact:\nValueGuard Life Insurance Company\nCustomer Service: 1-800-VALUE-GUARD\nEmail: service@valueguardlife.com\n\nExecuted at Minneapolis, Minnesota\n\n_______________________________\nPresident\nValueGuard Life Insurance Company\n\nDate: September 15, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n","summary":"This return-of-premium (ROP) life insurance policy carries a higher cost than standard term policies due to the guaranteed refund of premiums if no claim is made. The ROP payment upon maturity or termination is not treated as taxable income, though professional advice is recommended. Unlike some other policies, it does not accumulate cash value. Policyholders retain significant control through rights to change beneficiaries, convert to permanent coverage, assign the policy, or surrender it for a partial refund based on the ROP schedule. Age misstatements affect only the death benefit; ROP remains unchanged.","topics":["Return of Premium","Policy Features","Owner Rights","Tax Implications"],"facts":[{"name":"Higher Cost Due to ROP Feature","sentence":"This policy costs more than standard term life insurance.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["return of premium","policy cost comparison","term life insurance"],"entities":[{"name":"Return of Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-taxable payout upon termination","relational_anchors":["ROP benefit","ROP amount"]},{"name":"return of premium feature","type":"POLICY_FEATURE","role":"increases cost compared to standard term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"taxable gain","type":"CONCEPT","role":"not triggered by ROP payout","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"does not accumulate under this policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE","type":"CLAUSE","role":"adjusts death benefit based on actual age","relational_anchors":["correct age"]},{"name":"change beneficiaries","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"convert to permanent insurance","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"assign the policy as collateral","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"surrender the policy for the applicable ROP percentage","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"ValueGuard Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and policy administrator","relational_anchors":["home office","executed at Minneapolis, Minnesota"]},{"name":"1-800-VALUE-GUARD","type":"CONTACT_INFO","role":"customer service phone number","relational_anchors":["Customer Service:"]},{"name":"service@valueguardlife.com","type":"CONTACT_INFO","role":"official email address for inquiries","relational_anchors":["Email:"]},{"name":"Minneapolis, Minnesota","type":"LOCATION","role":"place where policy was executed","relational_anchors":["executed at"]},{"name":"September 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"execution date of the policy","relational_anchors":["Date:"]}]},{"name":"Return of Premium Cost Increase","sentence":"The return of premium feature causes this policy to cost more than standard term life insurance.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["return of premium","policy pricing","term life insurance"],"entities":[{"name":"Return of Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-taxable payout upon termination","relational_anchors":["ROP benefit","ROP amount"]},{"name":"return of premium feature","type":"POLICY_FEATURE","role":"increases cost compared to standard term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"taxable gain","type":"CONCEPT","role":"not triggered by ROP payout","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"does not accumulate under this policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE","type":"CLAUSE","role":"adjusts death benefit based on actual age","relational_anchors":["correct age"]},{"name":"change beneficiaries","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"convert to permanent insurance","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"assign the policy as collateral","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"surrender the policy for the applicable ROP percentage","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"ValueGuard Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and policy administrator","relational_anchors":["home office","executed at Minneapolis, Minnesota"]},{"name":"1-800-VALUE-GUARD","type":"CONTACT_INFO","role":"customer service phone number","relational_anchors":["Customer Service:"]},{"name":"service@valueguardlife.com","type":"CONTACT_INFO","role":"official email address for inquiries","relational_anchors":["Email:"]},{"name":"Minneapolis, Minnesota","type":"LOCATION","role":"place where policy was executed","relational_anchors":["executed at"]},{"name":"September 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"execution date of the policy","relational_anchors":["Date:"]}]},{"name":"Tax Treatment of ROP Benefit","sentence":"The ROP benefit is not considered a taxable gain when paid.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Return of Premium","tax-free payout","financial benefits"],"entities":[{"name":"Return of Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-taxable payout upon termination","relational_anchors":["ROP benefit","ROP amount"]},{"name":"return of premium feature","type":"POLICY_FEATURE","role":"increases cost compared to standard term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"taxable gain","type":"CONCEPT","role":"not triggered by ROP payout","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"cash value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"does not accumulate under this policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE","type":"CLAUSE","role":"adjusts death benefit based on actual age","relational_anchors":["correct age"]},{"name":"change beneficiaries","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"convert to permanent insurance","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"assign the policy as collateral","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"surrender the policy for the applicable ROP percentage","type":"OWNER_RIGHT","role":"right held by policy owner","relational_anchors":["applicable ROP percentage"]},{"name":"ValueGuard Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and policy administrator","relational_anchors":["home office","executed at Minneapolis, Minnesota"