  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2" target="33251068-e396-4859-a5c3-37749266fe3e">
  <data key="d3">A key feature of the policy is that it spans 20 years, defining the timeframe during which coverage applies and premiums are due. Each such long-term policy is assigned a distinct identifying number, like VG-ROP-2024-4183.</data>
  <data key="d4">HAS_POLICY_NUMBER</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2" target="5875c040-ac0c-4e62-bbe3-c3cc925fe67d">
  <data key="d3">The 20-year term defines how long the policy remains active from the issuance date, setting the timeframe during which premiums are paid and benefits may be claimed.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2" target="0206bbb5-5208-4620-a3d5-628ddd3d2bc6">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s 20-year term defines its duration, during which Nicole Christine Martinez is covered as the insured individual.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2" target="75bb8231-432e-4f86-bd53-b263adeb0b3a">
  <data key="d3">The 20-year term of the policy sets its duration, but this timeframe is independent of Nicole's birth date, which only informs her age at enrollment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2" target="1c3aed84-e6eb-4ded-bebd-4e205f38da55">
