  <data key="d3">The policy's end date of September 15, 2044, defines the final period during which the $300,000 death benefit remains applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMES_OUT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="5093abc8-a7d6-401e-907e-6b80f82d69d2">
  <data key="d3">The specified end date of September 15, 2044, confirms the policy’s 20-year duration, aligning with the stated term length.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS_FROM</data>
