  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">The end date of the policy does not influence the annual premium amount. The premium remains fixed regardless of the policy's expiration timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="600fcc21-f2ed-4013-854a-d0230dd726f7">
  <data key="d3">The end date of the policy does not influence the method by which premiums are paid annually. Annual payment refers to the timing of installments, unrelated to the policy's expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date on September 15, 2044, determines when the conditions for receiving the return of premium are met. This specific timeline enables the fulfillment of the financial clause outlined in the second statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="444a4f43-1071-49e4-ad9e-358f2bf54de9">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s termination date on September 15, 2044, provides temporal context but has no bearing on the marital relationship described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="1c93bad2-a530-4021-9ae6-510c48444611">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date on September 15, 2044, determines when benefits become payable but does not influence who the primary beneficiary is. Beneficiary status remains unchanged regardless of the policy’s end date.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="f0614009-4ad3-4925-af16-fcdd6c7ce2a0">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date on September 15, 2044, provides temporal context but does not influence the identification of the contingent beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="47224cc0-60b9-43a5-887d-8ab3626989c4">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination on September 15, 2044, marks the moment when the death benefit becomes due if Nicole passes away before then, triggering the payment to the designated primary beneficiary, Carlos Roberto Martinez.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 identifies the policy's expiration date; fact_sentence_2 confirms this date as the endpoint for returning premiums, reinforcing its significance in the policy’s lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the termination date of the policy, which serves as the critical deadline referenced in fact_sentence_2 for triggering the return of premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, marks the exact point when the full refund of $32,400 becomes due, confirming that this amount corresponds to 100% of premiums paid over the 20-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the policy's expiration date, which directly determines when the full refund of premiums becomes available; this depends on the sustained payment of the $1,620 annual premium stated in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, directly corresponds to the deadline for the final annual premium payment, ensuring eligibility for the full return of premiums upon survival.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s end date on September 15, 2044, marks the deadline by which all premiums must be paid to trigger the full return of premiums under the ROP clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets the timeframe within which the death benefit can be claimed; thus, the condition in fact_sentence_2 depends on the timeline established by fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the termination date of the policy, enabling determination of whether the refund under fact_sentence_2 applies due to early death versus full-term survival.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="6e225e7e-3f3a-47fa-81d2-fc2a41f25361">
  <data key="d3">The expiration date of the policy on September 15, 2044, marks the endpoint at which the full return-of-premium amount becomes accessible under the terms outlined in the second fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="75bca4d7-1be0-4be8-b8fb-1cf86a7af494">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date sets the endpoint for all benefits, including the return of premiums, while the absence of aviation exclusions ensures that such events won't void claims during the active term.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="fb5287ce-2a2a-4ab9-aaea-67aab70121e0">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s end date on September 15, 2044, sets the final deadline for claims under normal circumstances, while the absence of war exclusions ensures that such claims remain valid regardless of conflict-related causes up to that point.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="b4003548-05a1-4f13-a791-01db074853b9">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date defines the endpoint for all benefits, including the return of premiums, while the absence of travel exclusions ensures continuous coverage up to that point without restrictions tied to mobility.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="71fd7901-e2e8-4c64-a67d-555c1e72b157">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date sets the endpoint for coverage duration, during which the absence of hazardous activity exclusions ensures uninterrupted eligibility for benefits unless otherwise restricted by other clauses like suicide or misrepresentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="562d8dc1-7081-489f-9ac5-c3774de62cee">
  <data key="d3">The expiration date of the policy sets a hard deadline beyond which reinstatement cannot occur, rendering the condition about providing evidence of insurability irrelevant once past September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="3cb7f968-8a8c-43f6-8023-1df17e94f6da">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s fixed end date creates a deadline by which reinstatement must be initiated to avoid permanent loss of coverage. This timing constraint makes the reinstatement clause conditionally relevant to maintaining benefits past the stated expiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="6c3f8840-4647-406b-9929-e1b67417fe7f">
  <data key="d3">The policy's end date limits the timeframe during which reinstatement could occur, making survival prior to September 15, 2044, essential for eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="976d21fc-a08c-4c4a-994c-c5ac61731c42">
  <data key="d3">The policy's fixed end date provides temporal context that limits the feasibility of reinstatement after lapses occurring too close to it, especially since reinstatement requires timely compliance with financial and medical criteria before expiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="06dca34d-1332-47ca-87cb-7fe487dab3a4">
  <data key="d3">The policy's end date constrains when reinstatement might happen, thereby influencing whether a new suicide and contestability period under fact_sentence_2 can be activated.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="c1512491-2648-4091-bf70-f69ea67b0895">
  <data key="d3">The policy's fixed end date sets the ultimate deadline for receiving the return-of-premium benefit, but if the policy lapses and later renews, the ROP amount is adjusted to reflect only the continuous coverage period, effectively making the original end date conditional upon uninterrupted status.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913" target="b4a16075-b6bb-4b9d-8614-8a4e078e9175">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date on September 15, 2044, marks when the return-of-premium benefit becomes payable, justifying the higher cost described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f674bcd2-b9fe-4456-9906-4bf80c3351c7" target="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913">
