  <data key="d3">Carlos Roberto Martinez is identified as the husband, who serves as the primary beneficiary in the ROP policy. This role is defined by the policy's structure, but the statement about him alone does not convey any aspect of the policy’s return-of-premium feature.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
