  <data key="d3">Carlos Roberto Martinez's role as the primary beneficiary is unrelated to the 20-year term duration of the policy. This detail pertains solely to benefit distribution upon death, regardless of when the policy expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
