  <data key="d3">Carlos Roberto Martinez is designated as the primary beneficiary who would receive proceeds upon the insured's death. This information does not influence or relate directly to whether premiums are refunded after surviving the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
