  <data key="d3">Carlos Roberto Martinez is entitled to receive the death benefit if the insured dies within the term. This entitlement is independent of the total premiums paid, though the sum of those payments determines whether a refund occurs at maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
