  <data key="d3">The total premium payment reflects the cost of maintaining coverage, whereas submitting a claim form is part of the post-death benefit procedure. They relate to separate stages of the policy lifecycle—one before any event occurs, the other triggered after a claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
