  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 confirms the cumulative payment of premiums totaling $32,400, which enables the full return of premiums if the insured lives through the term. This supports the condition under which the death benefit may also apply, ensuring financial protection regardless of outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
