  <data key="d3">If the insured survives the 20-year term and all premiums are paid, the full amount of premiums ($32,400) is returned. This event is independent of the identity of the beneficiaries like Sofia Isabella Martinez.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a" target="ac78d07a-693a-4a41-896b-89ccec21e2ab">
  <data key="d3">If the insured lives through the entire 20-year term and has made all required payments, the full amount of premiums paid — $32,400 — is returned to the policyowner. This event is independent of the named beneficiaries’ identities.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
