  <data key="d3">If the insured survives the 20-year term and all premiums are paid, the full amount of premiums ($32,400) is returned to the policyholder. This refund condition has no direct connection to who the contingent beneficiaries are.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a" target="d51df73f-63ad-42b9-83f4-36facdbba04e">
  <data key="d3">If the insured survives the 20-year term and all premiums are paid, the policy returns $32,400 to the policyowner. This event has no direct connection to Marco Daniel Martinez’s status as a contingent beneficiary, which only applies in case of the insured’s death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
