  <data key="d3">The return of premiums upon survival is unrelated to how benefits are distributed among contingent beneficiaries after the insured’s death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">The policy's return-of-premium feature, described in fact_sentence_2, confirms one of its defining characteristics introduced in fact_sentence_1—the nature of an ROP term life insurance policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
