  <data key="d3">The policy provides life insurance coverage throughout its 20-year term, ensuring financial protection for beneficiaries like Carlos Roberto Martinez, who is designated as the primary recipient of the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_BENEFICIARY_RIGHTS</data>
