  <data key="d3">The policy provides life insurance protection throughout the term, ensuring that beneficiaries like Sofia Isabella Martinez are eligible to receive benefits if the insured dies before the end of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.4</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="d51df73f-63ad-42b9-83f4-36facdbba04e">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers life insurance protection during its term, ensuring that beneficiaries like Marco Daniel Martinez can receive benefits upon the insured’s death. His designation as a contingent beneficiary relies on the policy’s protective function.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="ce60053c-f1bb-490a-ac19-16ad07280772">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers life insurance protection throughout its 20-year term, ensuring financial support to beneficiaries like Sofia and Marco if the insured dies before maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">Life insurance protection during the term is a defining feature of a Return of Premium (ROP) Term Life Insurance Policy, making this factual detail directly dependent on the prior classification.</data>
  <data key="d4">IS_PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="9a6c8495-0658-4de0-97a4-d8a49c0fec55">
  <data key="d3">Life insurance protection is meaningful only within the specified 20-year term; thus, the existence of such protection relies on the established term length.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">Life insurance protection during the term enables the possibility of surviving it, thereby qualifying the policyholder for the full return of premiums after 20 years.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">Life insurance protection during the term necessitates regular premium payments; without them, the coverage would lapse, making the payment essential for sustaining the benefit described.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
