  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac">
  <data key="d3">The policy's provision of life insurance protection during the term enables the payout of a $300,000 death benefit upon the insured’s passing within the term period.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="cf7084aa-de51-4c4d-b872-2f550bc9320d">
  <data key="d3">The policy's provision of life insurance protection during the term enables the payout of $300,000 to the beneficiary if the insured dies while the policy remains active.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers temporary life insurance coverage during the term, and within that framework, it allows the policyholder the option to switch to permanent insurance later.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers life insurance protection throughout its term, ensuring financial support for beneficiaries if the insured dies within that period. In such cases, the full death benefit is paid alongside any proportionally refunded premiums, reinforcing the dual nature of the ROP feature.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054" target="834d28a5-622d-4fec-8a75-c824a028663b">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s provision of life insurance protection creates the scenario under which a claim may arise; consequently, a certified death certificate becomes necessary documentation to validate the claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
