  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the term policy to permanent insurance is independent of Carlos Roberto Martinez’s status as the primary beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="2092accb-1370-4d13-a1f1-a49167717503">
  <data key="d3">The availability of a conversion option allows the policyholder—such as Carlos Roberto Martinez—to transition to permanent insurance, leveraging his ownership rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">UTILIZES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="005768d3-95ad-47d7-b1be-d0b3a5673f4b">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers an option to convert to permanent insurance, independent of the beneficiary designations such as Sofia Isabella Martinez’s status as a contingent beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="ac78d07a-693a-4a41-896b-89ccec21e2ab">
  <data key="d3">The availability of converting to permanent insurance is an independent policy provision that has no bearing on the identification of beneficiaries like Marco Daniel Martinez.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="bca9d2c6-7752-46c3-9597-61cc8abf7e89">
  <data key="d3">The policy offers an option to convert to permanent insurance, which provides long-term coverage beyond the term. This feature has no bearing on the identity or share of contingent beneficiaries like Sofia Isabella Martinez.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="d51df73f-63ad-42b9-83f4-36facdbba04e">
  <data key="d3">The availability of converting the policy to permanent insurance affects long-term coverage options but has no bearing on who receives the death benefit or their designation as a beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="ce60053c-f1bb-490a-ac19-16ad07280772">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the term policy to permanent insurance is a structural benefit unrelated to how death benefits are distributed among beneficiaries. It pertains to future policy flexibility rather than current payout rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of a conversion option to permanent insurance implies the existence of a flexible term policy framework, consistent with the nature of a Return of Premium (ROP) Term Life Insurance policy described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="9a6c8495-0658-4de0-97a4-d8a49c0fec55">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance is a standalone policy feature unrelated to the specific 20-year term length.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance does not impact whether premiums are refunded at the end of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">The availability of a conversion option to permanent insurance exists independently of how much was paid in premiums over the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a">
  <data key="d3">The availability of converting to permanent insurance does not influence whether the full premium amount is refunded after 20 years; they operate as separate features.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of a conversion option enables the policyholder to transition from term coverage to permanent insurance, adding long-term planning potential beyond basic term protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="cf7084aa-de51-4c4d-b872-2f550bc9320d">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance provides future flexibility but does not impact the immediate death benefit payout specified in the second sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance is a standalone policy feature unrelated to the specified death benefit amount. It offers long-term options but does not influence the $300,000 payout upon death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="834d28a5-622d-4fec-8a75-c824a028663b">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance pertains to post-term options available to the policyholder but does not influence the documentation required for a death benefit claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="26e92023-05f0-4e85-a993-49935b7f2e09">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance relates to post-term options but does not affect the process of submitting a claim form upon the insured's passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="80b3a0f3-2ae7-4269-ae27-bcba28448f8f">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the term policy to permanent insurance relates to future options post-term but does not affect the requirement for submitting identification during a claim process.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance offers future coverage options but does not influence how death benefits and refunds are distributed at claim time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance increases the policy’s overall value and justifies its higher cost relative to standard term life insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIES_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="817d0dcb-1390-42ee-b441-ff53e6769ad8">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance enhances the policy’s flexibility, contributing to its higher cost compared to standard term plans.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31" target="7164e6d5-1695-4226-9fba-8a306539e438">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance enhances long-term planning options, while the right to change beneficiaries ensures ongoing alignment with personal circumstances. These features operate independently yet together support comprehensive policy management.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
