<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="55fb2d1d-cd7c-45a8-ac06-1cf18f6fa769">
  <data key="d3">As the primary beneficiary, Carlos Roberto Martinez is eligible to receive the $300,000 death benefit if the insured dies during the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENTITLED TO PAYMENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="34938dcf-3e35-4563-87da-55be923c02a2">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is payable specifically to Carlos Roberto Martinez because he is named as the primary beneficiary under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYABLE_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="2092accb-1370-4d13-a1f1-a49167717503">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is a contractual obligation of the policy and remains unchanged irrespective of the owner’s share, including Carlos Roberto Martinez’s 100% ownership.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="005768d3-95ad-47d7-b1be-d0b3a5673f4b">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is the total sum payable upon the insured's passing, split equally among the contingent beneficiaries, including Sofia Isabella Martinez, who is designated as one such recipient.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="ac78d07a-693a-4a41-896b-89ccec21e2ab">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is the sum payable to the designated beneficiaries, including Marco Daniel Martinez, who is listed as a contingent recipient.</data>
  <data key="d4">DETERMINES_VALUE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="bca9d2c6-7752-46c3-9597-61cc8abf7e89">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit serves as the financial sum available for disbursement to named beneficiaries, including Sofia Isabella Martinez as a contingent recipient.</data>
  <data key="d4">SOURCE OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="d51df73f-63ad-42b9-83f4-36facdbba04e">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit determines the total sum available for distribution among the named contingent beneficiaries, including Marco Daniel Martinez.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="ce60053c-f1bb-490a-ac19-16ad07280772">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is divided equally between the two contingent beneficiaries, Sofia Isabella Martinez and Marco Daniel Martinez, who each receive half.</data>
  <data key="d4">ALLOCATED TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a $300,000 death benefit confirms the nature of the policy as a Return of Premium (ROP) Term Life Insurance, highlighting one of its key features.</data>
  <data key="d4">IS_PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="9a6c8495-0658-4de0-97a4-d8a49c0fec55">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is applicable throughout the 20-year policy term, making it relevant specifically during this duration.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYABLE WITHIN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">The second fact defines the death benefit amount available when the insured passes away during the term. This outcome is independent of whether premiums are refunded, which occurs only under survival conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is set at $300,000, a predetermined sum payable upon the insured’s death during the term. This amount remains unchanged irrespective of how much was paid in premiums, including the full $32,400.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a">
  <data key="d3">A $300,000 death benefit is payable only if the insured dies during the term. This differs from the premium return condition, which applies solely when the insured survives the entire term.</data>
  <data key="d4">ALTERNATIVE_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="5ff7a5d2-f300-426c-a845-7a6982ac1054">
  <data key="d3">A $300,000 death benefit is made possible because the policy provides life insurance protection throughout the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">IS_ENABLED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is determined by the policy's coverage level and remains unchanged regardless of whether the policyholder chooses to convert to permanent insurance later.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="cf7084aa-de51-4c4d-b872-2f550bc9320d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the monetary value of the death benefit, which is elaborated on by fact_sentence_1 through its conditional trigger (insured dying during the term).</data>
  <data key="d4">SPECIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="834d28a5-622d-4fec-8a75-c824a028663b">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit of $300,000 is payable only after the proper documentation, including a certified death certificate, is verified by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="80b3a0f3-2ae7-4269-ae27-bcba28448f8f">
  <data key="d3">The $300,000 death benefit is payable upon proof of the insured's passing, requiring supporting documents including a government-issued ID from the beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit of $300,000 is paid upon the insured's passing during the term, and this payment occurs regardless of whether a premium refund applies. Fact_sentence_2 adds that such a refund may also be issued concurrently.</data>
  <data key="d4">ADDITIONAL_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="26e92023-05f0-4e85-a993-49935b7f2e09">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit amount of $300,000 defines what is owed upon the insured's passing, while submitting a completed claim form is required to initiate the disbursement of that benefit. These elements function separately—one sets the financial outcome, the other governs access to it.</data>
  <data key="d4">NECESSARY_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit of $300,000 includes an added proportional refund of premiums when death occurs within the term, determined by the length of time the policy was active.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXTENDS_WITH_REFUND</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="56d974f0-7976-40f7-a400-a08ec69d94ac" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies the death benefit amount, which is confirmed and reiterated in fact_sentence_2 as the full payout received by beneficiaries if death occurs during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
