<edge source="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd" target="55fb2d1d-cd7c-45a8-ac06-1cf18f6fa769">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is paid in addition to a proportional premium refund, ensuring that the designated primary beneficiary—such as Carlos Roberto Martinez—receives full financial compensation from both components of the policy’s return feature.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd" target="34938dcf-3e35-4563-87da-55be923c02a2">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is distributed independently of the premium refund, which may be paid only if the insured survives the term; however, the primary beneficiary, Carlos Roberto Martinez, would still receive the full death benefit regardless of whether a refund occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
