</edge>
<edge source="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd" target="2092accb-1370-4d13-a1f1-a49167717503">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is paid on top of any refunded premiums when the insured dies during the term, regardless of ownership details. This means even though Carlos owns the policy outright, the payout includes both the death benefit and the refund, independent of individual ownership percentages.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
