  <data key="d3">The death benefit is paid along with a proportional refund of premiums if the policyholder outlives the term. This financial detail applies regardless of individual beneficiaries like Sofia Isabella Martinez, whose identity is separate from the payout mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
