  <data key="d3">The death benefit is paid in addition to a proportional refund of premiums when the insured dies during the term. This detail pertains to financial disbursement rules and does not depend on individual beneficiary identities like Marco's.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
