  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e8f2bfea-e66b-488f-86a1-43ceaf048efd" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">If the insured dies during the term, the death benefit of $300,000 is paid out regardless of the premiums already paid, meaning the $32,400 in accumulated premiums do not reduce or offset the death benefit.</data>
