  <data key="d3">When the insured dies during the term, the death benefit is triggered and paid out independently of whether premiums were refunded. This outcome relies on the prior existence of the policy’s protective function described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
