  <data key="d3">The requirement to provide a certified death certificate ensures that only rightful beneficiaries, such as Sofia Isabella Martinez, can validate eligibility and proceed with claiming the policy payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR_CLAIMING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
