  <data key="d3">Submitting a certified death certificate is a procedural requirement triggered only when a death occurs during the policy term, which is precisely the situation the policy was designed to cover.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
