  <data key="d3">Submitting a certified death certificate is required to initiate the process that enables the release of the death benefit along with any applicable premium refunds.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="834d28a5-622d-4fec-8a75-c824a028663b" target="26e92023-05f0-4e85-a993-49935b7f2e09">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a certified death certificate supports the verification of the insured's passing, which is prerequisite to initiating any claim. This step enables the processing of subsequent documents like the claim form.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
