  <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 offers concrete context by identifying the individual involved (Nicole Christine Martinez), naming beneficiaries, and confirming key figures like the $300,000 death benefit and $1,620 annual premium that align with the general framework described in chunk 2.</data>
