<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The policy's end date on September 15, 2044, sets the condition under which the ROP payout becomes applicable. The receipt of $32,400 by the policyowner is explicitly tied to survival past this exact date.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination on September 15, 2044, marks the endpoint where the full premium refund of $32,400 is triggered if all conditions are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">TERMINATES_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">The termination date of the policy sets the boundary within which early surrenders occur. Since the return of premium varies by surrender year up to the final maturity date, knowing when the term ends enables accurate application of the refund schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, defines the timeframe within which surrender penalties apply; specifically, early surrenders before Year 6 result in zero premium return due to the defined schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMING_DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s termination date on September 15, 2044, defines the timeline that makes Year 6 through Year 10 eligible for a 30% premium refund upon surrender. Without knowing the policy’s endpoint, it would not be possible to determine when those mid-term surrender provisions apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, defines the window during which death-related claims qualify for a proportional premium refund under the early surrender schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date defines the duration during which coverage applies. Death occurring before or on September 15, 2044, triggers the full death benefit payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, defines the timeframe within which the 60% premium refund for Years 11–15 occurs, establishing that this partial refund window lies well before the final maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration on September 15, 2044, marks the point at which the full premium refund becomes available, making it the endpoint where the 100% return clause activates.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s termination on September 15, 2044, triggers the ROP payout process, which is scheduled to occur within 60 days after this milestone date.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">The policy's termination date on September 15, 2044, defines the timeframe within which partial refunds like those in Years 16–19 occur, establishing the boundary condition under which such surrender provisions apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration on September 15, 2044, determines the final deadline for premium payments, ensuring that the last installment coincides with the conclusion of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date is set for September 15, 2044, marking the conclusion of coverage. This endpoint is unrelated to the fixed annual payment of $1,620 required each year.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date on September 15, 2044, ensures that premiums remain unchanged throughout its duration because they are locked in for the entire term length.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENSURES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration on September 15, 2044, sets the deadline by which all conditions—including full premium payments—must be met to trigger the return of premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 contextualizes the end date as critical for receiving full refunds; fact_sentence_1 establishes that date definitively, supporting the condition outlined in the second statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date of September 15, 2044, determines the period over which the $1,620 annual premium is paid, aligning with the total 20-year coverage term.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes the deadline by which the policy must remain active for the return of premium described in fact_sentence_1 to apply. This makes the financial outcome conditional upon reaching that specific endpoint.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
