  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 indicates that death during the term triggers a partial refund using the same schedule referenced in fact sentence 1, implying that the refund framework established for survival is reused in case of premature death.</data>
  <data key="d4">USED IN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
