</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">Since ROP payments are issued within 60 days of the applicable event date, the conclusion of the policy term on September 15, 2044, sets the deadline by which such refunds must be processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">DETERMINES_TIMING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The ROP payment of $32,400 is disbursed within 60 days after the policyholder meets the survival condition on September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS_TIMING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">ROP payouts occur within 60 days after the event date, ensuring timely delivery of benefits such as the $32,400 refund due upon survival to maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS_PAYOUT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">Refunds are issued within 60 days after surrender, contingent upon the surrender occurring at any point during the policy term, where the refund rate varies by duration.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMING_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">The 60-day timeframe for ROP disbursement assumes the policyholder qualifies for a refund, such as after Year 5, thus presupposing the conditions outlined in the earlier statement about non-refundability in early years.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">Refunds under the ROP program, including those for surrenders in Years 6–10, are disbursed within 60 days of the event, ensuring timely delivery of the agreed-upon 30% return.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYMENT_TIMELINE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">The payment of 60% of premiums upon surrender in Years 11–15 occurs within 60 days of the surrender event, ensuring timely delivery of the refund.</data>
  <data key="d4">PAYMENT_TIMING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">The ROP payment is delivered within 60 days of the surrender event, ensuring timely disbursement once the eligibility criteria—like being in Year 16–19—are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMING_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">The insurer pays out 100% of premiums at Year 20 only if the surrender occurs, and such payments are guaranteed to happen within 60 days of the event date.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The timing of ROP disbursements relies on the occurrence of events such as death, which activates the obligation to pay out the death benefit and associated refunds.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">Payments for the proportional refund are triggered by the insured’s death during the term and occur no later than 60 days after the event, ensuring timely disbursement based on the refund schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMING_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">ROP payments occur within 60 days after the qualifying event, such as survival to maturity or surrender. This timeline is independent of the fixed annual premium amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d3">The timing of Return of Premium payments is specified, occurring within 60 days of the triggering event. This timeline operates regardless of whether premiums remain level, which is separately confirmed.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">ROP payments occur within 60 days after a qualifying event, such as survival to maturity or policy surrender. This timeline operates independently of when the annual premium is due each September 15.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The timing of ROP payments relies on qualifying conditions being met, such as having paid all premiums by the end of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
