<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">An annual premium of $1,620 is due every September 15 throughout the policy term. This recurring cost remains constant regardless of the policy’s final maturity date on September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $1,620 directly determines the total payments made, which equals the $32,400 returned if the policyholder survives to maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $1,620, when compounded over 20 years, results in the total payout of $32,400 under the ROP clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">MULTIPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the annual premium of $1,620 enables calculation of total premiums paid, which determines the basis for returning funds if the policy is surrendered early.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CALCULATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">The fixed annual premium of $1,620 determines the total amount paid over time, which influences whether any portion of those payments could be refunded under the early surrender rules described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $1,620 directly determines the amount subject to refund under the early surrender provisions, including the 30% return specified for Years 6–10.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CALCULATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes the fixed annual payment of $1,620, which directly informs the calculation behind the refund percentage specified in fact_sentence_1 for surrenders in Years 11–15.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CALCULATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that the annual premium is $1,620 allows calculation of accumulated premiums, which enables determination of the 90% refund applicable when surrendering in Years 16–19.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the annual premium of $1,620 allows calculation of the total premiums paid by Year 20, enabling determination of the full refund under the ROP clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The $1,620 annual premium ensures that the policy stays active, thereby enabling eligibility for the $300,000 death benefit should the insured pass away during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium is set at $1,620 per year. This consistent payment determines the cumulative premiums used to calculate any refund, including those given upon death.</data>
  <data key="d4">USED_IN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium is set at $1,620 per year, regardless of payout timelines. This figure determines total contributions but does not affect when ROP refunds are processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $1,620 must be paid by the specified date each year, ensuring continuous coverage under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $1,620 is maintained consistently each year without increases, ensuring predictable payment obligations over the policy's lifetime.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the annual premium is $1,620 establishes the financial obligation needed to meet the condition for receiving the full return of premiums upon survival to maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 provides the key financial detail—the $1,620 annual premium—that enables calculation of the total payments over time, culminating in the $32,400 refund tied to the policy’s conclusion on September 15, 2044, as specified in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 reiterates the $1,620 annual premium mentioned in fact sentence 1, providing additional detail about its fixed nature and payment timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2's assertion of a $1,620 annual premium enables the computation underlying fact_sentence_1’s promise of a $32,400 return after 20 years.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e5bea87f-a041-4bfc-86b3-999b94d69293" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">basis_for_annual_premium</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e5224944-c7f8-4789-9385-b498e22d0677" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
