</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay the annual premium every September 15 ensures timely fulfillment of obligations up to the policy’s terminal date, which is set for September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The necessity of paying the annual premium on September 15 enables the accumulation of required payments needed to meet the conditions for receiving the $32,400 return upon survival to 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies the recurring payment obligation, which directly contributes to determining the total premiums paid—the basis for the $32,400 figure stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CALCULATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">Regular premium payments due on September 15 enable accurate tracking of policy duration, which determines the percentage of premiums returned if the policy is surrendered early.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes the recurring deadline for premium payments, which indirectly supports the context of fact_sentence_1 by defining the timeline within which surrenders may occur. However, it does not explain or depend on the refund rule itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes the recurring payment obligation tied to the policy’s anniversary date. This regularity supports the accumulation of premiums over time, which underpins the calculation of refunds like those mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that premiums are due annually on September 15 allows one to determine how many premiums have been paid by any given point in Years 11–15, enabling accurate application of the refund rule.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that premiums are due annually on September 15 helps establish the timeline necessary to qualify for the 90% refund if the policy is surrendered during Years 16–19.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the deadline of September 15 for annual premiums ensures eligibility for the 100% refund at the end of Year 20.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The obligation to pay the annual premium on September 15 maintains active policy status, enabling benefits like the death benefit to apply should the insured pass away during the term. However, the timing of payments does not alter the amount received by beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium is scheduled for September 15 regardless of whether a claim arises due to death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that payments occur on September 15 applies specifically to the $1,620 annual premium, defining its schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a">
  <data key="d3">Annual premiums are required by September 15 each year, regardless of whether a payout event occurs later. The due date does not affect the 60-day window for processing ROP payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that all premiums be paid to qualify for the full return depends on consistently paying the annual premium by its due date, September 15.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes when premiums are due annually; this regularity is possible because the premiums remain unchanged over time, as stated in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 ties into the policy’s conclusion on the same date, making timely payments essential for receiving the full refund after 20 years.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">The due date of September 15 mentioned in fact_sentence_2 aligns with the annual premium amount of $1,620 stated in fact_sentence_1, establishing a consistent schedule for premium payments over the policy’s duration.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the deadline for the annual premium payment on September 15 supports ongoing compliance with the policy terms, enabling the eventual receipt of the $32,400 return upon survival to the end of the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ee33a568-9195-44e5-b6ba-626afeabdab0" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">due_date</data>
</edge>
