  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">SUBSECTION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="954a0960-f529-48f5-9d69-4fb08f6f3c44">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CRITICAL_NOTE</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums imply a stable financial commitment over time, which aligns with the policy’s definitive end date of September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of receiving $32,400 depends on paying all premiums; stable premiums make this outcome predictable and achievable over the 20-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">NECESSARY_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable accumulation over time, making it possible to accurately calculate that $32,400 corresponds to 20 years of consistent $1,620 payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable financial obligations, enabling the insurer to apply standardized refund rates tied to the length of policyhold, directly influencing the outcome described in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable payment obligations, irrespective of whether a refund would apply upon early surrender.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable accumulation of paid premiums, forming the base amount used to calculate the 30% refund upon surrender during Years 6–10.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable payment totals over time, allowing the insurer to accurately compute the 60% refund applicable during Years 11–15 if the policy is surrendered.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">The high refund rate during later years depends on having consistently paid premiums, so stable premiums enable accurate application of the surrender refund formula.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">Fixed premiums ensure that the policyholder can reliably pay the same amount each year, enabling them to meet the conditions necessary to receive the 100% refund at Year 20.</data>
  <data key="d4">NECESSARY_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure predictable cost over time but do not influence the magnitude or timing of the death benefit received by beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">Fixed annual premiums ensure that the amount eligible for refund under the early surrender scale remains predictable, directly enabling the proportional refund specified when death occurs during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a">
  <data key="d3">Premiums are guaranteed to stay constant across the entire 20-year term. This consistency does not affect when refunds are issued, which are instead governed by separate rules tied to event dates.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">Because the premium is set at $1,620 per year, it remains unchanged throughout the entire 20-year term, guaranteeing financial predictability.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">The consistency of premium amounts across the term, described in fact_sentence_2, enables the predictable scheduling of payments specified in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The stability of premiums ensures consistent payments, enabling the policyholder to meet the requirement of paying all premiums needed to qualify for the full return.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b957063-8a77-46db-a97c-e3e04f084993" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">represents complete adherence to Level Premium Guarantee</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f161754f-2c74-4c68-a23a-f97cd2f217f3" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is the death benefit covered under the Level Premium Guarantee</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7a56c83d-25b4-4006-b06e-ce54ed1a0aad" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is the annually fixed premium maintained under the Level Premium Guarantee</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a4fd511f-f0df-4d54-8763-eb01cf72790d" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is the periodic (e.g., quarterly) premium component preserved under the Level Premium Guarantee</data>
</edge>
