  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">SUBSECTION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="d3387fdd-c34f-4f8c-bb32-9674c10220ff">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CRITICAL_NOTE</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="cd1ad5bf-716a-4727-9553-806be53f7978">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the requirement of paying all premiums ensures qualification for the full return of premiums exactly when the policy terminates on September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">Paying all premiums ensures eligibility for receiving the full $32,400 upon survival to the policy's maturity date.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">Paying all premiums ensures eligibility for the $32,400 return, which reflects 100% of accumulated premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="be98658a-9431-48d1-9c48-8e2bbc8f9f5c">
  <data key="d3">Full repayment at the end of the term requires consistent premium payments; without them, even late surrenders would not trigger the 100% refund despite being near the final year.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED TO QUALIFY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="b8941628-eb5b-462b-bb77-5e37980a9491">
  <data key="d3">Full ROP qualification hinges on uninterrupted payments over twenty years, making it impossible to claim returns before Year 6—even though partial refunds may exist post-Year 5.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="2291fcf7-1262-4d16-a497-fd39b8260cc2">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the full payment requirement ensures eligibility for the highest possible refund, including the 30% return applicable in Years 6–10 should the policy be surrendered before maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="37554481-a747-480f-b5ff-4064a09717c7">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the requirement of paying all premiums ensures eligibility not only for the final 100% return but also supports access to progressively higher refund rates earlier in the policy lifecycle, such as 60% in Years 11–15.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="2be37f90-16b7-4751-a378-763a991ab252">
  <data key="d3">Consistent premium payments are required to maintain eligibility for the 90% refund in later years, making timely payments essential for accessing higher surrender returns.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="a1316d59-f834-4b94-bf99-e1e6f0fab4b9">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the requirement of paying all premiums ensures eligibility for receiving 100% of premiums back when surrendering at Year 20.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="8f9837c0-a23e-4f57-9edf-a1e053c7fa11">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence defines the requirement for receiving a full refund of premiums at policy maturity, contingent on consistent premium payments throughout the term. This condition is unrelated to whether the insured died before maturity, where another set of benefits applies regardless of premium history.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="c89f0a7a-2453-4e9c-bef6-3c474f56b326">
  <data key="d3">For beneficiaries to receive any form of premium refund upon death, including those tied to the early surrender schedule, it is necessary that all premiums have been paid over the term, as required by fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="aef30bb1-b272-4deb-bbc2-68ebbf16702a">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the requirement of paying all premiums ensures that the policyholder becomes eligible for an ROP payout, which is processed within 60 days after the event.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="42e69377-0625-4ae5-a39b-739f702ac7a7">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the full return of premium benefit requires adherence to the annual payment obligation set forth on September 15.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="3426c616-0275-4cec-9ecd-43426037d96e">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums to qualify for the full return relies on the known annual premium amount being consistently fulfilled over the 20-year period.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="52b46745-e979-474e-98c8-d03bf1b89c96">
  <data key="d3">Qualifying for the full return depends on paying all premiums; thus, the certainty of fixed premiums makes fulfilling this condition possible.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums (fact_sentence_1) directly enables qualification for the return of premium, but failing to do so results in total forfeiture (fact_sentence_2).</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the baseline requirement for full ROP eligibility—on-time premium payments—while fact_sentence_2 adds a penalty condition: late payments reduce the return by 10%, undermining the fulfillment of the original condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the core condition for receiving the full return of premium, which is fully supported and elaborated upon by fact_sentence_2's emphasis on timeliness, ensuring no delays compromise eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="256028e2-0a3d-4e1d-8382-ed239b45e913">
  <data key="d3">For the policy to result in a full refund of premiums upon its conclusion, all required payments must have been made up to and including the final due date of September 15, 2044.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">To receive the $32,400 return of premiums referenced in chunk_summary_1, the $1,620 annual premium specified in fact_sentence_1 must be fully paid throughout the entire 20-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">Without consistently paying all premiums throughout the term, the $32,400 return cannot be received, even if the policy lasts its full duration.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="817d0dcb-1390-42ee-b441-ff53e6769ad8">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums ensures eligibility for the full return of premium, which explains why the policy incurs higher costs than standard term insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums (fact_sentence_1) enables the return of premium benefit, which justifies the higher cost of the policy compared to standard term life insurance (fact_sentence_2).</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="9d3d7a34-a79d-4b06-8284-d7e63952d8af">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums ensures qualification for the return of premiums, which remains intact even if the insured's age was initially misrepresented.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258" target="a176a4ea-8eba-4f29-8ca6-99b1da801960">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums ensures eligibility for any return upon surrender, making fact_sentence_1 foundational to the validity of fact_sentence_2’s assertion about surrendering for a refund.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
