  <data key="d3">The consistent annual premium of $1,620 ensures the policy’s continued existence, enabling the insured to maintain eligibility for the conversion privilege until the earlier of age 65 or policy expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
