  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the annual premium by the specified September 15 deadline may lead to the policy lapsing if not corrected during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. Failure to pay results in forfeiture of that benefit if the policy lapses.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay the annual premium by September 15 results in a forfeited return-of-premium benefit, as missed payments cannot be recovered under any circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for timely premium payment ensures continued eligibility for benefits, including the option to convert coverage later. This timing constraint supports long-term plan stability, enabling future actions like conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 creates the basis for determining whether a payment is considered late. If a payment occurs after this date but within the grace period, it triggers a penalty affecting the return-of-premium benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that premiums be paid annually on September 15 ensures ongoing eligibility for the policy’s features, including the ability to convert to permanent insurance later. This timely payment maintains access to key benefits like conversion privileges.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 ensures continued coverage but does not influence the availability of the conversion option. Conversion privileges depend solely on age and policy status, independent of timely premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 does not influence or relate to the maximum amount available upon converting to permanent insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 relates to maintaining eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit but does not influence the maximum conversion amount available under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that premiums be paid annually on September 15 sets a recurring deadline, while the conversion privilege has its own time limit based on age or policy expiry. These rules operate independently but contribute to overall policy timeline management.</data>
  <data key="d4">TEMPORAL CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence specifies when the annual premium is due, but it provides no information about conversion privileges or amounts. The second sentence states a minimum dollar threshold for converting to permanent insurance, which is independent of the payment deadline mentioned earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that premiums are due annually on September 15 sets the schedule for maintaining coverage, but does not directly affect how future premiums are calculated upon conversion to permanent insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">Timely premium payments enable eligibility for return-of-premium benefits, but if the policyholder converts to permanent insurance, those past payments are no longer eligible for refund.</data>
  <data key="d4">TERMINATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for annual premium payment on September 15 does not influence nor relate to the restriction on policy loans. Both are independent features of the policy's terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of the annual premium on September 15 maintains eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, which is terminated if the policyholder exercises the conversion option.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 relates to financial commitment timing but does not influence whether partial withdrawals are allowed. This restriction exists independently of the payment deadline.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">Timely premium payments ensure eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, which determines the payout amount when accessing cash value either through full surrender or at maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_DEPENDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">The ROP feature depends on consistent annual payments, so the fixed due date of September 15 enables the policyholder to meet the obligation necessary to receive the full return of premiums after 20 years.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_BENEFIT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="9a6c8495-0658-4de0-97a4-d8a49c0fec55">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the annual premium be paid on September 15 applies specifically across the entire 20-year term, making the term duration essential to understanding when these obligations occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of the annual premium on September 15 ensures eligibility for the 100% return of premiums outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay $1,620 annually on September 15 ensures the accumulation of $32,400 in premiums, enabling the full return upon policy maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the September 15 deadline ensures all premiums are paid on time, which is required for the $32,400 return upon survival after the 20-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_RETURN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="3cd53960-22e5-4307-8561-6aa1ffcfc09a">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay $1,620 annually aligns with the deadline of September 15, ensuring timely fulfillment of the policy’s financial obligations.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="600fcc21-f2ed-4013-854a-d0230dd726f7">
  <data key="d3">The second fact’s specification of the payment date supports the validity of the annual premium model described in the first fact, enabling proper fulfillment of terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of the annual premium on September 15 is essential to qualifying for the $32,400 return upon policy maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
