  <data key="d3">The rule requiring the annual premium to be paid on September 15 each year depends on the policy being issued on that date, ensuring consistent renewal dates across the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
