<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">The obligation to pay all premiums on time hinges on awareness of the specific annual cost, which is set at $1,620, ensuring compliance with the terms for receiving the full refund.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of the annual premium by September 15 is necessary to meet the condition for receiving the full return of premiums upon policy maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of level premiums is essential to securing the full return-of-premium benefit, meaning the fixed premium amount directly supports compliance with this condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay within the grace period causes the policy to lapse, preventing fulfillment of the condition required for the full return of premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for on-time premium payments to secure the full return depends on whether a grace period exists to accommodate minor delays. Without such a buffer, even small lags could disqualify the beneficiary from the full return.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">Timely premium payments are required to maintain eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. Failure to pay leads to policy lapse, which triggers loss of the return benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment is required for the full return of premiums, and since missed premiums cannot be made up, any delay permanently disqualifies the policyholder from the benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment is required to secure the full return of premiums; if any payment is late, even within the grace period, the return is diminished by 10%, directly linking non-compliance with a specific financial penalty.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. This condition stands independently from the option to convert the policy into permanent insurance later.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the full return of premiums, while the option to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 provides flexibility in coverage type but does not affect the return-of-premium terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, while the availability of conversion before expiration provides another option for policyholders seeking long-term coverage. These clauses operate independently regarding their respective conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the on-time premium requirement ensures eligibility for the full return-of-premium benefit. This does not affect the minimum conversion amount required when exercising the conversion privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">Failing to pay premiums on time forfeits the full return-of-premium benefit, but this does not affect the deadline for converting to permanent insurance. The requirement to maintain timely payments stands independently from the window during which conversion may occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the full return-of-premium benefit. This does not influence or depend on the maximum conversion amount available under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for timely premium payments ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. This does not influence the maximum conversion amount available under the policy’s conversion privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">Timely premium payments are required to maintain eligibility for the full return of premiums, but if the policyholder chooses to convert it into permanent insurance, that right is permanently lost regardless of payment history.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES FORFEITURE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. However, once converted to permanent insurance, the new premium depends on the insured’s attained age, independent of past payment history.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit. This obligation stands independently from restrictions on accessing cash value through policy loans.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">If all premiums are paid on time, the full return of premiums is guaranteed unless the policyholder converts it before maturity. However, once converted, even if premiums were paid on time, those amounts are forfeited and not returned.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums on time ensures eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, while the prohibition on partial withdrawals limits how cash value may be accessed before termination. These rules operate independently within the policy’s framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">If all premiums are paid on time, the policyholder qualifies for the full return of premium at maturity, which is one of the two permitted methods to access cash value—either through full surrender with the return applied or waiting until term end.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 adds temporal precision to fact_sentence_1’s general rule, clarifying that "paid" means "paid on time," thereby strengthening the original statement with specific enforcement criteria.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPANDS_UPON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 explains the requirement necessary to trigger the return of premiums mentioned in fact_sentence_1, making it a prerequisite for realizing the financial benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITION_FOR_RETURN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="9a6c8495-0658-4de0-97a4-d8a49c0fec55">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay all premiums on time ensures eligibility for the full return of premiums after the 20-year term, directly linking the fulfillment of this obligation to the long-term financial outcome specified in the original fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 enforces the requirement necessary for fact_sentence_1’s outcome—the full return of premiums—to occur, making it a prerequisite condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">PREREQUISITE_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">Timely payment of all premiums ensures eligibility for the full return of $32,400, making the stated premium amount conditional upon adherence to payment deadlines.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
