  <data key="d3">Timely payment of the $1,620 annual premium is necessary to secure the promised return of $32,400 at the end of the 20-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR_RETURN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
