<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 does not affect the required annual premium of $1,620.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 is unaffected by when the annual premium is paid. This right exists regardless of whether premiums were submitted on September 15 or later.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">The option to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 provides flexibility later in life. This feature operates independently of whether premiums are fixed or variable.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 is independent of whether premiums were paid on time, although it terminates the return-of-premium feature if exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">Eligibility to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 is independent of the grace period for premium payments. Even if a payment is made during the grace period, it doesn’t extend or alter the window for conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 depends on maintaining active policy status, meaning timely premium payments are required to retain eligibility for this option.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance is possible before age 65 regardless of whether the return-of-premium benefit has been lost due to lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">The option to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 exists independently of whether missed premiums can be recovered, as conversion terminates the return-of-premium feature regardless.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 exists independently of premium payment status. Late payments impact the return-of-premium benefit but do not restrict conversion options.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 enables the exercise of the no-medical-proof conversion privilege under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies that conversion is permitted before the insured turns 65, which falls within the broader period defined in fact_sentence_1 where conversion is allowed before policy expiration. This makes the former a conditional restriction of the latter.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUBSET_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 states that conversion is possible before age 65, but fact_sentence_2 clarifies that this window closes if the policy expires first, establishing a temporal limit based on both events.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 sets a timing condition under which the conversion privilege applies, while the requirement of a minimum $50,000 conversion amount defines the financial threshold for exercising it.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 establishes when the option exists, and the maximum conversion amount being equal to the current face value determines how much coverage can be obtained under that option.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 sets a temporal condition under which the conversion privilege applies. This timing constraint does not affect the specified maximum conversion amount of $300,000.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 leads directly to the termination of the return-of-premium benefit upon execution of the conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 sets the eligibility window during which the insured can switch policies. Upon exercising this option, the resulting premium is calculated using the insured's actual age at the time of conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert before age 65 triggers the termination of the return-of-premium benefit, resulting in no refund of premiums already paid.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 does not affect the restriction on policy loans. This statement stands independently from loan provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance before age 65 does not affect the restriction on partial withdrawals. Both are independent policy provisions governing access to benefits but operate separately.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before age 65 pertains to changing coverage type without medical evidence, while access to cash value is restricted to full surrender or maturity. These are separate operational provisions within the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
