<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for converting to permanent insurance—before age 65 or policy expiry—depends on the policy remaining active, which in turn relies on uninterrupted premium payments like the required $1,620 annual fee.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">The conversion privilege expires early if the insured reaches age 65 or the policy matures, regardless of premium payment schedules. Although the September 15 due date governs financial obligations, it does not influence the window for converting coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">TEMPORAL CONSTRAINT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to convert before age 65 or policy expiry sets a temporal boundary unrelated to whether premiums rise or stay fixed, so it doesn't affect the premise of stable premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for converting to permanent insurance—by age 65 or before expiration—is independent of whether premiums were paid on time. However, missing payments impacts eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, regardless of conversion timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that conversion must occur before age 65 or before policy expiration sets a temporal boundary unrelated to the grace period for premium payments mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance must happen before age 65 or before the policy expires—the earlier date applies. Missing a premium could lead to lapsed status, making such conversion impossible even if deadlines have not yet passed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NECESSARY_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">The conversion must occur before age 65 or before policy expiry, whichever comes first, regardless of whether premiums were paid timely or not.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to convert before age 65 or policy expiry governs access to permanent coverage, regardless of whether premiums were paid on time. Missed premiums prevent return-of-premium benefits but do not alter the conversion timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for converting to permanent insurance is determined by age 65 or policy expiration, regardless of whether premiums were paid late. Late payments impact the return benefit but do not alter conversion timelines.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert to permanent insurance without medical proof is conditional upon doing so before turning 65 or before the policy expires, whichever comes first.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes that conversion must occur before either policy expiration or turning 65, thereby restricting the broader claim in fact_sentence_1 about timing flexibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">REFINES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 defines the deadline for conversion as the earlier of the insured’s 65th birthday or policy expiration, which directly constrains the availability mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">The timing requirement for converting the policy (before age 65 or before expiration) operates independently of the minimum dollar amount required for conversion ($50,000).</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">If the insured converts the policy before age 65 or before expiration, they lose eligibility for the return-of-premium benefit, as stated in the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for converting the policy to permanent insurance is set by the earlier of age 65 or policy expiration. This temporal constraint does not affect the maximum amount eligible for conversion, which is determined independently based on the current face value.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for conversion—before age 65 or before expiration—affects the insured's attained age at conversion, which in turn determines the premium rate for the new permanent policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the deadline for converting to permanent insurance based on age or policy expiration. This does not relate to the second sentence, which prohibits policy loans regardless of any timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">If the conversion occurs before age 65 or before policy expiry, it triggers the termination of the return-of-premium feature, resulting in non-refundability of past premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The deadline for converting the policy into permanent insurance is determined by the earlier of age 65 or policy expiration. This temporal restriction does not affect the maximum allowable conversion amount, which is capped at $300,000 regardless of timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_LIMIT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the deadline for converting to permanent insurance based on age or policy expiration. This does not influence nor relate to the second sentence's prohibition on partial withdrawals.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">Conversion must happen before age 65 or before policy expiry, whichever comes first. This restriction does not affect how cash value is accessed, which is limited to full surrender or maturity payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
