<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">The minimum conversion amount of $50,000 is specified, yet it is not connected to the $1,620 annual premium in the provided information.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence mentions a minimum conversion amount of $50,000, but this figure has no bearing on the timing or requirement of premium payments described in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies a minimum conversion amount of $50,000 when switching to permanent insurance. This figure has no bearing on whether premiums stay level over time.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">A minimum conversion amount of $50,000 applies if switching to permanent insurance. This rule operates independently of whether premiums were paid on time for the return-of-premium benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that conversions must involve at least $50,000 does not influence the availability of a 31-day grace period for premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the conversion amount be at least $50,000 applies during the conversion process, independent of whether premiums were paid on time or caused a lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">A minimum conversion amount of $50,000 applies when converting to permanent insurance, independent of whether premiums were paid on time or if the return-of-premium benefit was lost.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">The minimum conversion amount is set at $50,000 regardless of payment history. Whether premiums were missed or paid on time has no bearing on this threshold.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that conversions must meet a minimum amount of $50,000 has no connection to the consequences of paying premiums late.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">A minimum conversion amount of $50,000 applies when exercising the option to convert to permanent insurance without medical underwriting.</data>
  <data key="d4">SETS_THRESHOLD</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">A minimum conversion amount of $50,000 applies when exercising the conversion option, which may be done anytime before the policy's expiration date.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">A minimum conversion amount of $50,000 establishes a financial criterion that must be met when converting, regardless of whether the individual qualifies based on age, including being younger than 65.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">The minimum conversion amount of $50,000 applies regardless of whether the conversion occurs before age 65 or before policy expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the baseline limit for conversion eligibility, while fact_sentence_2 defines the cap, together establishing the range of available conversion amounts under the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">BOUNDARY_RANGE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that conversions must involve at least $50,000 sets a financial threshold for initiating the conversion privilege. This minimum ensures sufficient coverage when transitioning to permanent insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the minimum threshold for conversion, ensuring that beneficiaries receive at least $50,000 upon conversion. Fact_sentence_2 specifies that the maximum allowable conversion cannot exceed the policy’s current face amount, capping the available coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY_LIMITS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The policy allows conversion to permanent insurance with a minimum amount of $50,000, but it also prohibits any form of partial withdrawal from the policy's cash value.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for a minimum conversion amount of $50,000 pertains to switching to permanent insurance, whereas the unavailability of policy loans relates to accessing cash value. These are independent restrictions within the policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance triggers the termination of the return-of-premium benefit, regardless of the conversion amount. This outcome applies whenever conversion occurs under the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_CONVERSION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance requires meeting a minimum coverage amount of $50,000, after which any premiums already paid are forfeited upon conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_ON_CONVERSION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies a threshold requirement for exercising the conversion option into permanent insurance. Fact_sentence_2 outlines the restricted methods available to withdraw funds from the policy’s cash value, emphasizing that such access occurs only upon full surrender or maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a7605956-90b6-4688-b4e2-8fdb8c540b87" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
