<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount being equal to the current face amount depends on the policy’s structure and eligibility, independent of the specific dollar value of the annual premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount being equal to the current face amount has no connection to the due date of the annual premium.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount being tied to the current face value reflects underwriting flexibility, regardless of whether premiums are fixed or variable.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount is capped at the current face value of the policy, regardless of whether premiums were paid on time. Timely payments affect the return-of-premium benefit but do not alter the conversion limit.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">The cap on conversion amounts based on the current face value does not affect the availability or duration of the 31-day grace period for premium payments, as they pertain to separate policy mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount is capped at the policy’s current face amount, regardless of whether past premiums were paid timely or if the policy has lapsed due to delinquency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">The conversion privilege allows access to permanent coverage up to the current face amount, regardless of whether the return-of-premium benefit was lost due to lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount is determined independently of past payment history, so even if premiums were missed, the conversion cap remains tied to the current face amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount is determined solely by the policy’s face value and is unaffected by whether premiums were paid late or on time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The maximum amount available upon conversion matches the current policy's face value, ensuring alignment with the original coverage limits. This cap applies regardless of whether medical proof was required.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount being equal to the current face amount defines the upper bound of what can be converted, regardless of when during the term the conversion occurs, including anytime before expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">The cap on conversion size—the current face amount—applies specifically within the window where conversion is permitted, such as before the insured turns 65.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">The maximum convertible amount matches the policy’s current face value, regardless of when the conversion occurs. However, conversion must still happen before age 65 or before expiration, whichever comes first.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 determines the highest possible conversion amount based on the policy’s existing face value. This cap interacts directly with fact_sentence_1, which ensures that even if the face amount exceeds $50,000, conversions below that figure are not permissible.</data>
  <data key="d4">BOUND_BY_MINIMUM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The current face amount determines how much one may convert under the policy’s conversion privilege. Since the maximum possible conversion is capped at $300,000, any face amount above this threshold would still be limited by that dollar cap.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb">
  <data key="d3">The conversion privilege allows switching to permanent insurance using the existing face amount, and the resulting premium is determined by the insured’s age at that time.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">Converting the policy under the stated limit results in termination of the return-of-premium benefit, meaning the ability to recover paid premiums is permanently lost upon exercise of the conversion privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSEQUENCE_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount is capped at the policy’s current face value, but this detail does not affect the restriction on policy loans, which remain prohibited regardless of conversion eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">The policy allows conversion to permanent insurance up to the face amount, but does not permit partial withdrawals, meaning cash value access is restricted to full surrender or maturity.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">The maximum conversion amount sets the upper bound of coverage available when switching policies, but once conversion occurs, any premiums already paid are lost, meaning the policyholder cannot recoup earlier investments despite gaining access to permanent insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITS CONSEQUENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">The conversion privilege allows switching to permanent insurance up to a certain limit, but does not affect how cash value may be accessed. Accessing cash value is restricted to surrender or maturity, independent of conversion eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
