<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="7fa3f73b-8826-46ec-b4b0-ce2bf73a452d">
  <data key="d3">While the original policy has a set annual premium of $1,620, any future conversion to permanent coverage results in a new premium determined by the insured’s attained age rather than the original rate.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="86e64861-deab-4ac4-a343-0965992b4344">
  <data key="d3">The calculation of premiums for a converted policy based on attained age depends on the individual's current age at conversion, independent of the original premium due date specified in the initial policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="cb413827-b3ae-48d1-91af-f9043f9af205">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent coverage, the resulting premium is determined by the insured’s current age. This contrasts with the original policy where premiums stay constant regardless of age changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="7314500d-44bb-4471-85ef-f7159db5e8ec">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent insurance, the premium rate is set according to the insured’s current age. This change does not affect the original condition that all premiums must have been paid on time to retain the return-of-premium benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="aacfe1a1-50cb-4a0f-b92f-585491bb31a4">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount post-conversion depends on the insured's age at that time, independent of any grace period provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="16950aa2-96cc-49d7-82e7-9c271feae822">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount post-conversion is set according to the insured’s attained age, regardless of whether previous premiums were delayed or missed. Past non-payment may have already caused the policy to lapse, making conversion impossible.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="5f1f4076-64e8-474a-9882-b1eb76ae4168">
  <data key="d3">The second statement indicates that when converting to permanent insurance, the new premium depends on the insured’s current age. This condition stands independently from whether premiums were paid timely, which governs the return-of-premium benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="f9289efc-c4d1-43b2-b195-d430210c3e20">
  <data key="d3">The premium upon conversion is determined by the insured's attained age, regardless of whether previous premiums were missed. Missed premiums prevent recovery of the return benefit, independent of future conversion decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="fc446cb8-cff7-4839-af40-f8f635e80d6d">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount after conversion depends on the insured's current age, independent of past payment history or timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="790d6283-257a-4b49-ba90-001cca666300">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that conversion premiums depend on attained age means that earlier conversions lead to lower costs, reinforcing why timely conversion matters despite the loss of return-of-premium benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="b2fca366-b20a-44a1-90b5-1fd965a9c28c">
  <data key="d3">Since the premium for the converted policy is calculated using the insured's attained age, the opportunity to convert earlier (before expiry) may lead to lower premiums compared to converting later when older.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="4f1b8053-abbc-4db1-bef3-444bf9ee8a3b">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent insurance, the premium amount depends on the insured's attained age, making it essential that such conversions occur within the specified timeframe—before age 65—to maintain access to the conversion privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="8137a6da-6508-4c6a-972b-8593add581bd">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount after conversion is calculated using the insured’s current age at the time of conversion, making it dependent on whether the conversion happens before age 65 or before the policy expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="47677240-df4c-430b-8559-b97fbc6bd329">
  <data key="d3">After converting, the premium cost depends on the insured's current age at the time of conversion, reflecting actuarial risk adjustments tied to aging.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="0f394164-4990-4d22-9ccc-0de82ecc6299">
  <data key="d3">The premium for the converted policy depends on the insured's attained age, subject to a maximum convertible amount of $300,000.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="d48c4b09-f755-40f7-86b5-87f5374d83de">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent insurance, the premium rate adjusts according to the insured’s attained age, ensuring the maximum convertible amount matches the current policy face value.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="ab97e8fc-5b0b-4cdc-8c51-20501dcc87d7">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent insurance, the premium amount adjusts according to the insured's attained age, but doing so results in the immediate termination of the return-of-premium benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSEQUENCE_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="1233ae69-913e-4cbe-8257-e9ce2d717e4f">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance triggers a new premium calculation based on the insured's age at that time, but this change does not affect loan availability, which remains restricted regardless of conversion status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="fdb3964a-1dd5-48be-85ed-7f975e84c191">
  <data key="d3">When converting to permanent insurance, the premium amount depends on the insured’s current age, which explains why previously paid premiums are not retained—they do not carry over into the new policy structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="99b3ae6a-0f70-4f20-a89c-8b78a2e28a24">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance triggers a new premium calculation based on the insured's current age, but this does not affect the prohibition against partial withdrawals, which applies regardless of conversion status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c100aa7-42e6-46f4-9012-c65d6466d8cb" target="119358df-e2ac-44bd-93c0-290a863c3911">
  <data key="d3">Conversion triggers a change in premium calculation based on current age, but does not affect how cash value may be accessed. Access to cash value remains limited to surrender or maturity regardless of conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
