  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains how cash value may be accessed under certain conditions related to surrender or maturity. Fact_sentence_2 outlines a condition that voids the death benefit entirely if suicide occurs within two years of policy issuance, unrelated to cash value distribution.</data>
