  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 outlines methods for withdrawing accumulated cash value from the policy, focusing on surrender options and timing. Fact_sentence_2 states that the policy does not exclude coverage for hazardous activities, which relates to underwriting risks but does not affect the availability or method of cash value withdrawal.</data>
