  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 outlines methods for receiving cash value from an active policy, while fact_sentence_2 specifies one requirement for reviving a lapsed policy. Though related to policy flexibility, they address separate stages: benefit access versus restoration eligibility.</data>
