  <data key="d3">Accessing cash value requires either surrender with ROP deductions or surviving to term end. This process is distinct from reinstating a lapsed policy, which involves repaying delinquent premiums with interest but does not directly enable immediate cash value withdrawal.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
