  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the general rules for accessing cash value via ROP. Fact_sentence_2 clarifies that if the policy is reinstated after lapse, the ROP reset ensures the excluded lapsed time does not reduce the eventual payout, thereby preserving the integrity of the original ROP terms relative to active coverage periods.</data>
