  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 outlines the limited options for accessing cash value from the ROP policy, such as surrender or waiting until term end. This directly supports and contextualizes fact_sentence_1’s assertion about the return of 100% of premiums after 20 years, confirming that this outcome is achievable only through the specified paths outlined in fact_sentence_2.</data>
