  <data key="d3">The limitation on accessing cash value—only via full surrender with adjusted ROP or final maturity—is directly dependent on whether premiums were paid on time; otherwise, the entire ROP benefit is lost, making compliance critical for realizing those options.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
