  <data key="d3">If an insured commits suicide within two years of issuance, no death benefit is paid. This restriction aligns with the broader principle that insurers may challenge claims due to material misrepresentation during the same two-year contestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
