  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines an exclusion for suicide-related claims during the early policy period. This does not influence or depend on the second sentence, which describes how the Return-of-Premium (ROP) benefit is recalculated when a policy is reinstated after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
