  <data key="d3">Since the policy returns all premiums only if the insured survives the term, the lack of hazardous activity exclusions helps maintain the integrity of this outcome by preventing arbitrary disqualification due to lifestyle choices.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="71fd7901-e2e8-4c64-a67d-555c1e72b157" target="d3dbbdfc-8830-4d2b-9fb8-abe4fce9331c">
  <data key="d3">The absence of hazardous activity exclusions means the policy remains active even if the insured engages in high-risk behaviors, which does not affect the premium payment obligation stated in fact_sentence_1 but expands the circumstances under which claims may still be honored.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
