  <data key="d3">While the return of premiums depends solely on survival and payment history, the lack of hazardous activity exclusions reinforces the policy’s broad applicability, making it more likely that such a scenario would occur without disqualification.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES_COVERAGE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
