  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 addresses the process of reinstating a lapsed policy within five years if certain requirements are met. This scenario does not influence or depend on the methods outlined in fact_sentence_1 for accessing cash value via surrender or term-end payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
