  <data key="d3">Reinstatement rights after a policy lapse do not affect the applicability of the suicide exclusion during the initial two-year period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb7f968-8a8c-43f6-8023-1df17e94f6da" target="ea5bc4dd-d91e-4ff2-90de-0cc747100f5f">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy triggers a new two-year contestability period, meaning that even if earlier misrepresentations were undetected, they could still lead to denial upon reinstatement if discovered early in the renewal window.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
