  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires meeting specific criteria like proof of insurability and payment of past dues, independent of whether war-related risks are excluded from coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
