  <data key="d3">Reinstatement eligibility within five years after a lapse depends on meeting specific requirements such as proving insurability and repaying past-due premiums. Whether or not travel exclusions exist does not impact the reinstatement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
