  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 explains the reinstatement window of five years after a lapse, which does not depend on whether hazardous activity exclusions exist, as noted in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
