  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy maintains the possibility of qualifying for the $32,400 premium return, provided all requirements—including timely premium payments—are fulfilled post-reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3cb7f968-8a8c-43f6-8023-1df17e94f6da" target="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy resets the ROP calculation and restarts the contestability period, potentially affecting whether the $32,400 return is still available upon reaching the final term.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
