  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy necessitates paying overdue premiums with 6% interest. This action restores coverage and allows future eligibility for cash value via ROP upon reaching the term’s end, although it doesn’t grant instant access to funds.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
