  <data key="d3">Repaying overdue premiums with 6% interest is necessary to reinstate a lapsed policy, regardless of whether war is excluded from coverage. The payment condition stands independently of any exclusion clauses.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
