  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires catching up on missed premiums with interest, which contrasts with the guaranteed refund only available when premiums are paid consistently throughout the full term without interruption.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.55</data>
</edge>
