  <data key="d3">Repayment of unpaid premiums—including those tied to the $1,620 annual rate—is necessary to reinstate the policy, meaning the premium figure from fact_sentence_1 is foundational to fulfilling the reinstatement obligation detailed in fact_sentence_2.</data>
