  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 highlights the increased cost of the policy caused by the return-of-premium feature. This economic characteristic does not influence whether aviation-related claims are excluded, nor is it affected by such exclusions. The absence of aviation exclusions stands independently from the policy’s pricing model.</data>
