<edge source="b4a16075-b6bb-4b9d-8614-8a4e078e9175" target="b4003548-05a1-4f13-a791-01db074853b9">
  <data key="d3">Sentence 2 highlights that the policy's higher cost stems from the return-of-premium feature. While this economic characteristic is unrelated to exclusion policies like those involving travel, it contributes to understanding why such a comprehensive policy might carry increased premiums despite lacking certain exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
