  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 highlights that the policy’s elevated price stems from the return-of-premium benefit. This economic characteristic has no bearing on whether hazardous activities are excluded, which is governed by separate underwriting rules unrelated to premium structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
