  <data key="d3">The higher cost of the ROP policy enables the provision of a refundable amount upon surrender, aligning with its design to return premiums when no claims occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
