<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="bc29191c-c670-4cf2-8605-a8b1f962fa5e">
  <data key="d3">Higher premiums reflect the insurer’s obligation to repay all paid premiums if the insured outlives the term, directly enabling the return-of-premium feature described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">DRIVES_COST</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="76ec6ed4-6f6f-47dc-9640-e032dc95e13a">
  <data key="d3">The elevated cost of the policy stems from the built-in promise to return all premiums if the insured outlives the term, ensuring full recovery of payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="884ef424-e8e1-4bf5-bf91-395b93140734">
  <data key="d3">The reason this policy costs more than standard term life insurance is because it includes a promise to return 100% of premiums at the end of the term, provided no claims are filed, as detailed in the first summary.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIES_PREMIUM_DIFFERENTIAL</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="0ff7a95c-a146-4ec1-9ada-e9ee6ce46b31">
  <data key="d3">The elevated price of the policy reflects its enhanced features, including the option to convert to permanent insurance, making it more flexible than basic term plans.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCED_BY_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="75780d21-da26-475c-b202-9491455a9f36">
  <data key="d3">The elevated cost of the policy ensures the availability of a $32,400 refund if the policy is held to term without a claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="1c93bad2-a530-4021-9ae6-510c48444611">
  <data key="d3">The increased cost of this policy—due to its return-of-premium feature—is directly relevant to the role of Carlos Roberto Martinez as the designated beneficiary, ensuring he receives benefits under specified conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS_BENEFICIARY_ROLE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="f0614009-4ad3-4925-af16-fcdd6c7ce2a0">
  <data key="d3">The increased cost of the policy stems from its return-of-premium provision, which enables future payouts to beneficiaries like Sofia Isabella Martinez should the primary beneficiary predecease the insured or if no claims occur during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="9d6e8c8d-386c-4d95-828f-985897635314">
  <data key="d3">The high cost of the policy noted in fact_sentence_2 is justified by the guaranteed $32,400 refund available when the insured survives to the maturity date, as stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIES_PAYOUT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="c58f2abb-08d5-4d9b-8e01-36501b9318c4">
  <data key="d3">The higher cost of this policy explains why $32,400 accumulates over 20 years—it compensates for the insurer’s obligation to fully refund premiums if the policyholder outlives the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIES_AMOUNT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="091a133f-a666-4ce6-99e0-7b5f5c79b9f9" target="2972655d-04e5-4677-b08a-0b7dec9c8258">
  <data key="d3">The elevated price of this policy (fact_sentence_2) reflects its built-in return-of-premium feature, making the fulfillment of premium obligations (fact_sentence_1) essential to realizing the financial outcome.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
