  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states that cash value cannot be accessed during the term, but since this policy does not accumulate cash value at all, this detail is consistent with its design. Fact sentence 2 offers a customer service hotline, which is irrelevant to the financial features described in sentence 1.</data>
