<edge source="7164e6d5-1695-4226-9fba-8a306539e438" target="26eb58bb-69a2-4679-a8d8-19898359d93f">
  <data key="d3">The ability to change beneficiaries allows policyholders to update beneficiary designations without altering the core policy structure, while conversion to permanent insurance offers an option to extend coverage beyond the term. These rights operate independently within the framework of policyholder control.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
