  <data key="d3">Changing beneficiaries allows flexibility in estate planning, while assigning the policy as collateral enables financial leverage. Both actions underscore the policyholder’s autonomy in managing the policy during its lifetime.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
