  <data key="d3">Policyholders’ ability to assign the policy as collateral highlights their control over the contract, which exists independently of the policy's elevated price point relative to standard term plans.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
